## 3.3.2 (2025-08-02)
### Fixed
- fix strength reduction not working when using only depth limit
- fix missing cases in command line parameters testing
### Added
- add emscripten support
- disable clearing hashtable using multiple threads with emscripten
- disable logfile with emscripten
- disable openingbook, personalities and tablebases with emscripten
- reduce max threads and max hash size with emscripten
### Changed
- increase maximum multipv to 256
## 3.3.1 (2025-07-12)
### Fixed
- fix EngineStrength parameter not working in version 3.3.0
- fix initialization of fixed depth search
- don't stop search by nodes before finishing depth 1
- revert changes to kpk bitbases because initialization was using too much stack
- fix multipv not cleared before search
- fix compilation warning in searchthread.cpp
## 3.3.0 (2025-07-05)
### Fixed
- fix warning in fen parsing
- simplifications in move ordering
- fix compilation warnings
- remove unused operator
- fix thread initialization in tuner, don't stop on unknown game result for FEN
- fix pawn storm evaluation, and psqt orientation, don't use negative term for pawn/king distance
- fix check nodes initialization
- SyzygyProbeLimit and SyzygyProbeDepth were inverted in config file
- fix aspiration window limits, and pv initialization
- fix depth search initialization in anlaysis benchmark and testsuite options
- clear pv only when needed in ybwc, and remove commented code
- update fathom
- fix hashtable cleared twice at launch
- fix uci lmr and null move pruning initialization
- fix uci depth output for current move

### Added
- rewrite move parser, fen parser, add pgn parser and use it to select tuning positions
- add a string_view tokenizer
- add UCI searchmoves option
- add analyze option in command line
- and add UCI search mate option
- change tuning command line parameters and add an option to play games and generate positions
- enable tuner in CI
- add stalemate in tuner playgames, and fix problems with random moves
- add more tests on fen strings
- add more tests on config and command line parameters
- clear hashtable using multiple threads
- add new uci option EngineLevel replacing UCI_Elo if used

### Changed
- change UCIinfo messages and simplify thread initialization
- remove SearchMode to allow multiple search end conditions
- don't stop search when a mate is found
- use default constructor for ChessHashNode
- simplifiactions in board
- simplify ChessMoveSort
- don't add best move in quiet searched move list for history
- return value optimization in makeMove function
- add emplace_back and front in ChessMoveSortList
- generate Zobrist keys at compile time using XorShiftStar
- generate kpk bitbases at launch
- improve passed pawns evaluation

## 3.2.1 (2024-02-03)
### Fixed
- fix initialization of UCI_LimitStrength
- improve nodes and strength reduction, and use new UCI Elo levels

### Added
- add missing std::
- use std:: for types from cinttypes
- use inline constexpr for eval parameters, and use move value type in moveorder
- use inline constexpr and staticconstexpr
- use nodiscard
